          "art_direction_en": "Professional 3:4 Russian marketplace poster. Show one dominant hero product: a single neat stack representing the container set, centered in the lower two-thirds with ample clear space above. Use a bright, clean kitchen-inspired background in soft warm white and pale beige, subtly blurred to keep focus on the product. Apply soft daylight-style lighting, gentle shadows, and a restrained palette of translucent white, warm wood, and muted food-pink accents. Place the bold Russian headline in a clean sans-serif font in the upper text zone; position up to two short callouts in compact rounded light panels along the right side without covering the product. Keep the layout minimal, premium, readable on mobile, and avoid collage composition or repeated product copies.",
